"file": "protocol_restart.md",
"section": "P03 — Eligibility (all E1–E7 must be established for INCLUDE)",
"quote": "A short conference report is not excluded by page count alone: it must establish (a) a defined inference method/system with inputs, decisions or procedure and (b) reported evaluation results with identifiable conditions and metrics. A demo/poster/work-in-progress label does not prove full-paper or peer-review status; if these required facts cannot be established, keep awaiting classification rather than assume eligibility. Link versions at step10; a preprint may supply identity/version linkage but not primary synthesis evidence."
},
